WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.280 --> 01:46.729
=Episode 17=

02:05.450 --> 02:07.150
(Sorry, Zhu Yu.)

02:07.510 --> 02:09.070
(But I need to enter
your sea of awareness.)

02:09.509 --> 02:11.910
(I must figure out something.)

02:42.430 --> 02:44.550
(So this is her sea of awareness?)

03:04.870 --> 03:05.510
Zhu Yu.

03:11.440 --> 03:12.790
How did you get in here?

03:15.280 --> 03:15.870
Zhu Yu,

03:16.870 --> 03:19.470
I learned the Meditation Spell
from the texts.

03:20.150 --> 03:20.870
I'm sorry

03:21.470 --> 03:23.510
for entering without permission.

03:25.040 --> 03:26.550
The Meditation Spell?

03:28.870 --> 03:30.230
What do you want to do now?

03:30.470 --> 03:31.360
I want to know

03:31.530 --> 03:33.720
if there's really a way
to undo the Husheng Spell.

03:34.280 --> 03:34.960
Husheng Spell?

03:36.720 --> 03:39.150
Is it for that ridiculous human?

03:40.400 --> 03:41.280
Jinzhao is not ridiculous.

03:41.550 --> 03:42.720
Don't say that.

03:44.000 --> 03:47.040
Selfish, hypocritical, greedy, angry.

03:47.640 --> 03:49.190
Humans fight

03:49.440 --> 03:50.360
and kill

03:50.470 --> 03:51.880
for their own interest.

03:52.240 --> 03:54.640
Is there anything humans won't do?

03:56.750 --> 03:57.440
Zhu Yu,

03:58.829 --> 04:00.600
why would you say such things?

04:01.440 --> 04:03.110
Why can't I?

04:04.520 --> 04:05.640
Humans are the only ones

04:06.190 --> 04:07.640
on this earth who can blush

04:08.390 --> 04:10.950
and who need to blush.

04:11.750 --> 04:14.000
You entered my sea
of awareness for a human.

04:14.190 --> 04:15.440
That's just despicable!

04:18.390 --> 04:19.560
You are not Zhu Yu.

04:21.000 --> 04:22.120
I have to leave.

04:22.470 --> 04:23.120
Don't leave.

04:26.390 --> 04:29.830
Since you're here, don't leave.

04:30.640 --> 04:32.600
Better stay and keep me company.

04:33.440 --> 04:36.280
After all, the Husheng Spell
can't be undone.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.750
Why bother staying with humans?

04:40.280 --> 04:41.130
What?

04:42.640 --> 04:46.909
The Husheng Spell doesn't exist at all.

04:48.110 --> 04:49.670
There is no Husheng Spell?

04:53.670 --> 04:54.830
Let me out!

05:09.950 --> 05:10.670
Qi.

05:26.800 --> 05:27.670
(It's Qi.)

05:27.800 --> 05:29.440
What's wrong, Jinzhao?

05:30.440 --> 05:32.520
Nothing. You guys go ahead.

05:32.670 --> 05:34.030
Are you sure?

05:46.670 --> 05:47.310
Qi,

05:49.110 --> 05:50.000
is that you?

05:59.670 --> 06:00.440
What happened to you?

06:15.630 --> 06:16.200
Qingfei.

06:18.670 --> 06:19.160
Xuwei.

06:20.040 --> 06:20.950
Our spies just told us

06:22.040 --> 06:24.880
Qi was accidentally injured
by Zhu Yu yesterday.

06:25.440 --> 06:26.070
Injured?

06:29.000 --> 06:30.600
This time, when you see Zhu Yu,

06:30.790 --> 06:33.320
you must remind her
to abide by our agreement

06:33.630 --> 06:36.510
and make sure Qi leaves there
as soon as possible.

06:37.880 --> 06:38.630
Understood.

06:42.680 --> 06:45.710
(Core of the Demon Realm,
Sea of Clear Skies)

07:02.670 --> 07:06.350
Your Lordship,
you have been here all night.

07:06.670 --> 07:07.720
You should rest.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.480
The young lord will surely recover.

07:12.510 --> 07:16.280
(For Yue Jinzhao,
you even risked your safety)

07:16.630 --> 07:18.440
(and entered my sea of awareness.)

07:28.160 --> 07:28.830
Your Lordship.

07:29.950 --> 07:31.200
The Hengdao Sect has sent people.

07:52.110 --> 07:53.320
(Among the Nine Springs, Mist Soul)

07:53.920 --> 07:55.920
(is the gloomiest
and most chaotic place in the world.)

07:56.390 --> 07:58.390
(It has strong time energy,)

07:58.920 --> 08:00.070
(so it can slow down time,)

08:01.000 --> 08:03.040
(make people forget
their recent memories and...)

08:03.160 --> 08:04.230
(Travel back in time.)

08:04.510 --> 08:05.280
(Travel back in time.)

08:09.790 --> 08:11.720
I heard Qi was injured.

08:12.630 --> 08:13.550
Don't worry.

08:13.790 --> 08:15.550
She's recuperating
in the Core of the Demon Realm.

08:15.760 --> 08:17.760
She'll be fine in a few days.

08:18.380 --> 08:21.320
(Mist Soul inside the Core
of the Demon Realm)

08:31.200 --> 08:32.480
Why would it be so serious?

08:53.630 --> 08:55.720
(The spring's power has made
a connection with Qi?)

09:03.790 --> 09:04.440
Master.

09:08.760 --> 09:09.440
Master.

09:16.670 --> 09:19.600
Master, can you please take me
to the Mortal Realm for fun?

09:19.720 --> 09:20.780
Please.

09:39.280 --> 09:40.490
Master.

09:48.920 --> 09:50.720
Shouldn't we be at the Yujie Hub?

09:50.950 --> 09:51.920
Where are we?

09:54.760 --> 09:55.390
I got it.

09:56.830 --> 09:59.000
You brought me to the Mortal Realm
I wanted to come to.

10:03.880 --> 10:04.510
Qi,

10:06.110 --> 10:06.760
who am I?

10:12.160 --> 10:13.200
You are my master.

10:13.670 --> 10:14.600
Huan.

10:15.560 --> 10:17.600
You are the nicest person
in the world to me.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.040
(Is it the power of Mist Soul)

10:22.830 --> 10:24.800
(that brings the memory of Qi
back to three years ago?)

10:38.410 --> 10:41.120
You thought I wouldn't recognize
you with a mask on?

10:47.750 --> 10:49.070
This mask is so ugly.

10:52.950 --> 10:54.920
(If this is a gift from heaven,)

10:56.390 --> 10:58.190
(then allow me to indulge for a moment.)

11:01.430 --> 11:06.070
Qi, do you remember Yue Jinzhao?

11:06.870 --> 11:08.070
Who is Yue Jinzhao?

11:09.510 --> 11:10.510
(I guessed it right.)

11:12.190 --> 11:12.990
Don't think about that.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.160
Let's hurry out

11:14.280 --> 11:15.760
to see what's delicious and fun.

11:21.430 --> 11:22.070
What's the matter?

11:23.390 --> 11:24.800
Others mustn't see us.

11:25.920 --> 11:26.600
I know.

11:26.750 --> 11:28.750
We sneaked out from the Yujie Hub.

11:30.560 --> 11:31.630
So we need to be careful.

11:40.110 --> 11:41.040
Your Lordship,

11:41.600 --> 11:43.870
we came this time
to deliver the Qiyuan Orbs for you.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.560
But I also want to remind you.

11:47.190 --> 11:49.870
Do you still remember the agreement?

11:50.240 --> 11:51.870
Bian Luohuan
didn't keep his mask on tight,

11:51.990 --> 11:54.240
which led Yue Jinzhao
and the others to find this place.

11:54.510 --> 11:56.720
What right do you have
to hold us accountable?

11:58.480 --> 12:00.600
He had a moment of carelessness

12:00.720 --> 12:01.920
because he was trying to save Qi.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.680
Your Lordship,
you would understand, right?

12:06.040 --> 12:06.950
16 years ago,

12:07.480 --> 12:09.950
in order to save your clan,

12:10.680 --> 12:12.560
you bound Mist Soul with your own blood.

12:13.990 --> 12:15.990
And my eldest brother,
as the guardian of Mist Soul,

12:16.190 --> 12:17.800
to ensure the Nine Springs
would remain stable,

12:18.240 --> 12:19.950
made an agreement with you.

12:20.360 --> 12:22.560
You haven't forgotten all this,
have you?

12:24.280 --> 12:24.950
Of course not.

12:26.240 --> 12:28.070
You support the Qiyuan Sect

12:28.280 --> 12:30.070
to provide Her Lordship
with the Qiyuan Orbs.

12:30.190 --> 12:32.510
And Her Lordship had
our young lord taken away

12:32.870 --> 12:34.240
by you as a hostage.

12:35.070 --> 12:38.680
Over the years, Her Lordship
has never seen the young lord even once.

12:38.950 --> 12:41.510
Isn't that enough?

12:43.240 --> 12:47.430
But now, you keep Qi with you.

12:47.680 --> 12:49.750
Are you going to break our agreement?

12:51.390 --> 12:53.120
Sorry to be blunt,

12:53.750 --> 12:56.280
but why is Qi injured?

12:57.480 --> 12:59.680
Wasn't it you who hurt her?

13:05.800 --> 13:06.510
Take a look.

13:07.280 --> 13:07.950
Come on.

13:08.190 --> 13:08.910
Just take a look.

13:09.800 --> 13:10.480
Just take a look.

13:12.070 --> 13:12.720
This one's not bad.

13:14.430 --> 13:15.480
Do you like any of them?

13:16.830 --> 13:17.430
Do you want it?

13:19.240 --> 13:21.430
Qi, wait here for a moment.

13:24.950 --> 13:25.560
Take a look.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.310
How much are these two?

13:33.070 --> 13:34.990
You're a stranger here, right?

13:35.310 --> 13:36.120
We never

13:36.680 --> 13:38.630
take money for goods here.

13:38.990 --> 13:40.430
It's all about bartering.

13:44.160 --> 13:46.070
Is this okay?

13:49.600 --> 13:50.190
Yes.

13:52.120 --> 13:52.560
Thanks.

13:54.120 --> 13:54.720
Take care.

14:04.990 --> 14:05.560
Give it a try.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.680
Let me help you put it on.

14:17.930 --> 14:18.670
Look at that.

14:20.120 --> 14:20.800
It's so pretty.

14:27.150 --> 14:28.170
Look over there.

14:29.920 --> 14:30.630
Wanna take a look?

14:37.480 --> 14:39.120
This is a Green Conch.
It's not ordinary.

14:39.390 --> 14:42.240
It can record any sound.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.160
Here, it's all about bartering.

14:48.720 --> 14:50.070
I have nothing to my name.

14:51.800 --> 14:52.800
Nothing can be used for trade.

15:06.040 --> 15:06.870
Are these okay?

15:07.800 --> 15:08.780
No.

15:10.310 --> 15:11.980
Master, you're so poor.

15:13.680 --> 15:17.480
Girl, this can be traded.

15:18.720 --> 15:19.680
This cannot be traded.

15:28.430 --> 15:31.800
W-W-Why can't it be traded?

15:32.600 --> 15:33.830
When did I get this?

17:01.720 --> 17:03.160
(The power of Mist Soul is fading.)

17:04.240 --> 17:05.160
(Time is running out.)

17:07.119 --> 17:08.869
Qi, are you happy today?

17:09.510 --> 17:10.280
Yes.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.310
Today is my happiest day.

17:13.390 --> 17:15.680
This is also my happiest day
in three years.

17:19.369 --> 17:20.359
Listen.

17:21.740 --> 17:23.829
I want to eat all the delicacies

17:24.069 --> 17:25.950
and try all the fun things
in the Mortal Realm.

17:26.510 --> 17:28.240
I want to make many friends,

17:28.600 --> 17:30.310
just like in the stories,

17:30.750 --> 17:32.950
and go on adventures with them.

17:38.800 --> 17:39.390
(You will.)

17:41.960 --> 17:45.070
(I also want to listen to
storytelling, watch plays,)

17:45.310 --> 17:47.480
(and see flowers in the sky.)

17:47.800 --> 17:48.480
(You will.)

17:49.680 --> 17:51.050
(I also want to...)

17:53.310 --> 17:54.160
(You will.)

17:59.600 --> 18:01.190
(The power of Mist Soul is fading.)

18:02.480 --> 18:03.830
(And you're about to wake up soon.)

18:04.750 --> 18:07.660
♪Only through the eyes♪

18:08.240 --> 18:12.430
Master, don't you have
anything to tell me?

18:13.840 --> 18:19.240
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

18:21.800 --> 18:27.880
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

18:29.840 --> 18:36.360
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

18:36.360 --> 18:37.190
Sleep.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.720
When you wake up,

18:42.040 --> 18:44.160
you will forget this all.

19:05.960 --> 19:08.590
Whether Qi stays or leaves is up to her.

19:14.280 --> 19:16.560
Huan, when did you get here?

19:18.510 --> 19:19.390
Your Lordship,

19:19.960 --> 19:21.800
I hope you will stick to our agreement.

19:30.110 --> 19:31.350
I will consider it.

19:33.160 --> 19:34.090
Don't worry.

19:35.370 --> 19:36.400
Qi has fallen asleep.

19:38.990 --> 19:41.840
Your Lordship,
as long as you keep your promise,

19:42.200 --> 19:44.920
we will deliver the Qiyuan Orbs on time.

20:03.320 --> 20:04.200
The young lord is fine.

20:05.080 --> 20:08.390
It's just that there are
two masks beside her.

20:27.630 --> 20:28.630
I will keep this orb

20:29.390 --> 20:31.470
and study it carefully.

20:32.200 --> 20:34.800
If I can develop something
that counters it,

20:35.200 --> 20:37.710
it would be fortunate for the people.

20:38.680 --> 20:39.320
Mr. Zuo,

20:39.630 --> 20:41.230
Gao Xiao has already gone
to the headquarter,

20:41.680 --> 20:43.200
leaving only Meng Cheng
as the scapegoat.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.040
But we are already investigating

20:45.160 --> 20:46.280
its exact location.

20:46.630 --> 20:47.040
Good.

20:48.390 --> 20:50.350
Once we know more about it,

20:50.750 --> 20:51.870
we'll set off.

20:54.630 --> 20:57.390
Thank you for your hard work today.

20:58.960 --> 21:01.200
The two of you are tenacious

21:01.510 --> 21:03.040
and incredible.

21:03.590 --> 21:06.200
I wonder if you would like
to join our alliance.

21:09.920 --> 21:10.630
Shifang,

21:11.390 --> 21:12.920
this time you returned in glory.

21:13.230 --> 21:15.560
You'll still be the head
of the Jiqiao Hall.

21:17.800 --> 21:18.630
Thank you.

21:19.110 --> 21:21.510
I will fulfill my duties
as the head in the future.

21:23.840 --> 21:26.160
Miss Ming
has already joined our alliance.

21:26.440 --> 21:29.390
Why don't you two join as well?

21:32.320 --> 21:34.080
It would be a great pleasure

21:34.200 --> 21:35.280
to join you,

21:35.440 --> 21:37.680
but I'm the Master of the Luo family.

21:37.800 --> 21:39.200
I'm afraid I can't.

21:40.110 --> 21:41.320
I hope you can understand.

21:43.390 --> 21:45.160
(Joining them is not a bad idea,)

21:46.440 --> 21:48.230
(but they are in irreconcilable conflict
with demons.)

21:49.920 --> 21:52.440
Mr. Zuo, I am used to wandering out.

21:52.800 --> 21:53.870
I might have trouble adjusting.

21:54.590 --> 21:57.470
Please let me think about it.

21:59.560 --> 22:00.200
It's alright.

22:01.710 --> 22:04.710
Our gate is always open to you.

22:06.110 --> 22:06.750
Thank you.

22:57.840 --> 23:00.680
What? Someone's thinking of you?

23:01.350 --> 23:02.320
That would be great.

23:03.510 --> 23:04.590
But you, Hanjiang,

23:04.840 --> 23:07.200
you can't wait to see
tomorrow's sunrise, right?

23:08.590 --> 23:10.080
At least,

23:10.200 --> 23:12.390
it's more pleasing to the eye than you.

23:12.710 --> 23:13.680
Who wouldn't want to see it?

23:30.220 --> 23:31.180
I'm going to Pureness.

23:55.450 --> 23:56.260
You're awake.

24:03.570 --> 24:05.090
How're you feeling?

24:07.690 --> 24:08.840
Sore.

24:09.260 --> 24:12.060
Like I was in a fight in my dream.

24:18.210 --> 24:19.810
What happened yesterday?

24:21.260 --> 24:24.660
I remember I used the Meditation Spell

24:24.930 --> 24:26.810
and entered your sea of awareness.

24:27.300 --> 24:28.400
And then you...

24:36.570 --> 24:39.900
Zhu Yu, there is no such thing
as the Husheng Spell,

24:40.450 --> 24:41.140
right?

24:43.930 --> 24:44.660
You know now.

24:47.300 --> 24:48.140
You lied to me.

25:04.140 --> 25:05.330
I have my reasons.

25:05.690 --> 25:08.330
Then, what's the deal with you
in your sea of awareness?

25:11.500 --> 25:14.020
Qi, don't ask anymore.

25:14.810 --> 25:16.020
I don't want to lie to you.

25:19.180 --> 25:19.900
Zhu Yu,

25:23.330 --> 25:24.780
you're scary.

25:40.140 --> 25:41.330
Rest here.

26:11.790 --> 26:14.590
Zhaoyan, hope you're doing well.

26:18.220 --> 26:21.960
- Mount Yuqing...
- Mount Yuqing...

26:22.280 --> 26:23.670
Jinzhao, Shifang,

26:26.090 --> 26:27.370
I heard you calling my name.

26:27.370 --> 26:28.270
What happened?

26:29.870 --> 26:32.560
Well, Zhaoyan, sorry.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.030
We opened the letter.

26:34.350 --> 26:36.750
But I assure you
I only read the first line.

26:47.180 --> 26:49.870
(Zhaoyan, hope you're doing well.)

26:50.730 --> 26:51.760
(It's been a few days.)

26:52.490 --> 26:54.920
(I wonder how you guys have been.)

26:55.440 --> 26:58.350
(Mount Yuqing has stunning cloud views,
and it's comfortable.)

26:58.860 --> 27:00.270
(I'm looking out at Jing'an,)

27:00.560 --> 27:02.060
(thinking everything there
must be fine.)

27:02.990 --> 27:04.650
(Today is Xiu's birthday.)

27:04.940 --> 27:06.700
(Hanjiang and I are going there.)

27:07.850 --> 27:09.960
(We're about to see each other,
and I'm glad about that.)

27:12.970 --> 27:13.580
It's alright.

27:14.410 --> 27:15.340
Senior Xian Qing says

27:15.340 --> 27:16.840
it is Ming Xiu's birthday

27:16.840 --> 27:17.840
and that Mr. Gu will come.

27:18.570 --> 27:19.950
So it's Ming Xiu's birthday.

27:20.330 --> 27:23.080
Birthday? Then we need
to prepare birthday gifts.

27:47.620 --> 27:48.260
Excuse me.

27:48.700 --> 27:49.660
What is this for?

27:51.900 --> 27:54.410
Today is the death anniversary
of our former queen, Ling Ye.

27:54.510 --> 27:56.240
A grand sacrificial ceremony
is being held ahead.

28:00.900 --> 28:01.900
(Ling Ye?)

28:06.350 --> 28:07.280
Ling Ye?

28:12.060 --> 28:14.260
Why is Zhu Yu called Ling Ye now?

30:15.980 --> 30:16.820
You're leaving?

30:17.540 --> 30:18.700
I haven't decided yet,

30:19.500 --> 30:21.100
but I must tell Jinzhao

30:21.340 --> 30:22.780
that the Husheng thing is not real.

30:23.180 --> 30:23.980
You mustn't leave.

30:25.020 --> 30:26.100
That is my business.

30:26.460 --> 30:27.540
What's it to you?

30:27.660 --> 30:28.100
You!

30:29.420 --> 30:31.140
You come and go as you please.

30:31.300 --> 30:32.620
What do you take this place for?

30:33.300 --> 30:35.700
But all of you are lying to me.

30:36.540 --> 30:38.340
If you leave, what about Her Lordship?

30:38.980 --> 30:41.220
Haven't you seen how much she loves you?

30:43.860 --> 30:47.260
But she shouldn't have lied to me.

30:48.700 --> 30:51.660
And her other side.

30:52.340 --> 30:55.180
It's dark and terrifying,

30:55.420 --> 30:58.180
making me feel uncomfortable and scared.

31:00.420 --> 31:01.420
You saw it?

31:04.340 --> 31:05.020
You know it, too?

31:08.580 --> 31:10.220
Her Lordship will not harm us.

31:11.700 --> 31:13.300
You must have saddened
Her Lordship again.

31:13.540 --> 31:14.860
Go to apologize to Her Lordship.

31:16.020 --> 31:16.540
Shuo Xuan,

31:18.180 --> 31:20.460
ever since I met you
in the Jincui Oasis,

31:20.740 --> 31:22.660
you've been treating me badly.

31:23.100 --> 31:24.660
Do I owe you money

31:24.900 --> 31:26.900
or have I done something to you?

31:30.260 --> 31:31.420
You took away my mother.

31:34.820 --> 31:36.540
You are Zhu Yu's daughter, too?

31:40.100 --> 31:43.580
My mother was Ling Ye,
the previous queen of our clan.

31:45.380 --> 31:47.140
The body that Zhu Yu is using now

31:48.460 --> 31:50.060
is my mother's.

32:29.690 --> 32:33.370
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

32:34.720 --> 32:37.290
♪Burns what once was♪

32:38.810 --> 32:41.640
♪The name is forgotten♪

32:45.730 --> 32:49.250
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

32:50.650 --> 32:53.690
♪Only through the eyes♪

32:54.560 --> 32:57.610
♪Who can see them clearly♪

32:59.770 --> 33:05.810
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

33:07.530 --> 33:13.890
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

33:15.740 --> 33:23.230
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

33:23.780 --> 33:30.270
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

33:47.710 --> 33:51.700
♪The seemingly random paths♪

33:52.730 --> 33:55.590
♪The burning traces♪

33:56.670 --> 34:00.640
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

34:03.770 --> 34:08.070
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

34:08.699 --> 34:11.989
♪Are all carefully♪

34:12.770 --> 34:16.219
♪Arranged by me♪

34:17.690 --> 34:24.639
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

34:25.690 --> 34:32.670
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

34:33.690 --> 34:41.280
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

34:41.800 --> 34:48.960
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

34:49.440 --> 34:57.230
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

34:57.690 --> 35:05.250
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

35:05.630 --> 35:13.710
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

35:13.710 --> 35:21.850
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
